{
  "name": "01 · Lead Intake → AI Qualify → Instant Reply → CRM",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead intake & speed-to-lead\nPOST JSON to the webhook from any form (Typeform, Tally, Webflow, your site, or workflow 09/06).\n\n```json\n{\"name\":\"Jane Doe\",\"email\":\"jane@acme.com\",\"company\":\"Acme\",\n \"website\":\"acme.com\",\"message\":\"Need help with...\",\n \"budget\":\"10-25k\",\"source\":\"website\"}\n```\n1. Reads their website\n2. Claude scores fit 0–100 → hot / warm / cold\n3. Personalised reply in < 1 min (send or draft — see Config)\n4. Upserts the **Leads** sheet with next follow-up date\n5. Hot leads ping you",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 330,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9d55ec1d-a52c-467c-b542-7255e1237577",
      "name": "About",
